#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/variational-algorithm-design/ansaetze-and-variational-forms/extracted-outputs/9d3a813b-40cf-4399-b912-714893987c30-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/variational-algorithm-design/ansaetze-and-variational-forms/extracted-outputs/9d3a813b-40cf-4399-b912-714893987c30-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Summary {#summary}"
msgstr "Buod {#summary}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With this lesson, you learned how to define your search space with a variational form:\n"
msgstr "Sa araling ito, natuto ka kung paano tukuyin ang iyong search space gamit ang isang variational form:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare states with a _parametrized_ quantum circuit, where gates are defined with tunable parameters\n"
msgstr "Maghanda ng mga estado gamit ang isang _parameterized_ quantum circuit, kung saan ang mga gate ay tinukoy na may mga nababagong parameter\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to construct ansaetze that tradeoff speed vs accuracy\n"
msgstr "Kung paano bumuo ng mga ansaetze na nag-trade-off ng bilis kumpara sa katumpakan\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Heuristic ansaetze\n"
msgstr "Heuristic ansaetze\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Problem-specific ansaetze\n"
msgstr "Problem-specific ansaetze\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Our high-level variational workload looks as follows:\n"
msgstr "Ang ating mataas na antas na variational workload ay ganito ang hitsura:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A circuit diagram showing two unitaries: one preparing the reference state and another preparing the ansatz.](/learning/images/courses/variational-algorithm-design/ansaetze-and-variational-forms/ansatz-circuit.svg)\n"
msgstr "![A circuit diagram showing two unitaries: one preparing the reference state and another preparing the ansatz.](/learning/images/courses/variational-algorithm-design/ansaetze-and-variational-forms/ansatz-circuit.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For each variational parameter $\\vec\\theta$, a different quantum state will be produced. To find the optimal parameters, we need to define a problem-specific *cost function* to iteratively update our ansatz's parameters.\n"
msgstr "Para sa bawat variational parameter $\\vec\\theta$, isang iba't ibang quantum state ang malilikha. Para mahanap ang mga optimal na parameter, kailangan nating tukuyin ang isang problem-specific na *cost function* para paulit-ulit na i-update ang mga parameter ng ating ansatz.\n"
